{
  type: install
  message: <<EOM
Run "agy" to start the Antigravity CLI.  On first run it will prompt you to
sign in with a Google account.

The auto-updater is disabled by this port; update through mports instead.

To suppress invalid syscall messages in the kernel log while running agy(1),
add the following to /etc/sysctl.conf:

    compat.linux.debug=0

Or apply it immediately without rebooting:

    sysctl compat.linux.debug=0

If you are installing linux emulation for this port,
    sysrc linux_enable=YES
    service linux start
EOM
}
]
